{"obsah":"<p>Martin Šimůnek and Petr Manďák have worked together on the Pražské služby event for years. Unfortunately Martin couldn't make it this year, so he asked Vlasta and Lukáš Valný to stand in for him at this mega event at the company's main site. One show in front of the main stage and one by the U-ramp, in heat that was just about right. At the first exhibition the guys were joined by parkour athletes, so the obstacles were used ideally and there was a pile of action all in one place. Thanks for the invitation.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby2.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208924\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby4.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby4.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208923\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208922\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby5.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby5.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208921\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby3.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FPrazske-sluzby3.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208920\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>"}